## Note on dual-licensing

This MIT license covers the **code/harness** (`code/`, `prompts/`).

The **benchmark questions and reference answers** (`data/tier1/`, `data/tier2/`,
`data/tier3/`) are released separately under **Apache License 2.0** to ensure
the patent-grant clause applies for downstream educational and academic reuse.

A copy of the Apache 2.0 license terms applies to the `data/tierN/` content;
see https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0 for the full text.

This dual-license structure matches the prevailing pattern across open LLM
benchmarks (e.g., MMLU, HumanEval) where code and data are licensed separately.
